WEBVTT

00:07:00.413 --> 00:07:06.085
(Applause)

00:07:06.109 --> 00:07:10.576
There needs to be more fashion options
at all sizes and in all retailers.

00:07:12.546 --> 00:07:14.297
So finally, in 2018,

00:07:14.321 --> 00:07:17.537
Nordstrom actually
placed an order up to 3X.

00:07:17.561 --> 00:07:19.505
And this was a huge game changer for us

00:07:19.529 --> 00:07:23.094
to have a major retailer invest
in adding these units,

00:07:23.118 --> 00:07:25.275
so we could go to the factory --

00:07:25.299 --> 00:07:29.376
now we go up to 4X,
which is about a size 32.

00:07:29.400 --> 00:07:30.709
Having that investment